{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Play random sports mixed together!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Sportsday - each game is a randomly generated by mixing together different kinds of sports. Have you ever tried bowling with a baseball bat? Or football with a golf club? Who knows what weird sports you'll end up playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502930/extras/sportrandomizer.gif?t=1745305232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge your friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play against your friends in a tournament or casual games! Gather as many points as possible and see who ends up being the champion? Make sure to pick up power-ups and bonus points along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502930/extras/vs-screen.gif?t=1745305232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock new characters, outfits, and customizations!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Head to the locker room and pick your favourite character. Complete fun challenges and achievements to unlock new characters and outfits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502930/extras/character-customisation.gif?t=1745305232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502930?t=1745305232","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502930?t=1745305232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502930/d4f4fd6e87f3789972c9477d88317903e86a1124/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745305232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502930/d4f4fd6e87f3789972c94